children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No expense is required. You must first make a trip to a community clinic. The hard part is resisting the urge to book an appointment with a specialist right away."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Insured patients who follow this stepwise referral process can have their hospital deductible accumulated across multiple facilities. The deductible represents the portion of each hospitalization you must pay personally before insurance coverage kicks in. Accumulation means that the total paid at both the community clinic and the larger hospital counts as a single deductible amount, so you do not have to pay it again. For patients transferred from a larger hospital back to a community clinic, no additional deductible is applied for the same illness during that timeframe."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国务院办公厅 (2026). 关于加快建设分级诊疗体系的若干措施. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202604/content_7065031.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202604/content_7065031.htm"]},"：「统筹地区内经基层医疗卫生机构逐级转诊的参保患者，在上级医院的住院起付线可连续计算；由上级医院下转至基层医疗卫生机构的住院患者，同一疾病周期内不再另设住院起付线。」"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202604/content_7065031.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejo